5.0 Exemptions
5.1.
This Bylaw does not apply to:
a) employees or agents of Emergency Medical Services, Waterloo Fire Rescue Services, and Waterloo Regional Police Services, acting within the scope of their duties to provide emergency services or enforcement activities within a Park; or
b) employees or agents of the City acting within the scope of their duties.
